<title>LUXEMBOURG: Santer still hopes for budget pact deal.</title>
<headline>Santer still hopes for budget pact deal.</headline>
<dateline>LUXEMBOURG 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>European Commission President Jacques Santer said on Monday France's desire to study the EMU stability pact was &quot;understandable&quot; but that he still hoped it could be agreed by the Amsterdam summit on June 16 and 17.</p>
<p>&quot;I hope a solution can be found before Amsterdam,&quot; he told reporters.</p>
</text>
